                "loc": "DEU.23.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 23:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo nyo gha tya, kimi mïrön nko mïrönkö walaka cho kitïpisot otöp nyo pö cheporesnan otini kipöghisyechini tororötinekwa. Kigh nyu pipö Israel tïkwïl cho ghach tya kïtïl cho kigh pipö Kanan cho kiyona ECHOTYON tawungwa atökïpïsï kïcheng korengwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
